# Test Cases – Lecturalia.com

## TC-001 – Created a new user

**Preconditions:**
- User is on Lecturalia.com homepage.
- Internet connection is available.
- User dont have user created
  
**Steps:**
1. Press in the "person icon"
2. Select "New User" option
3. Put in user: Agos Fasanelli and in mail agosfasanelli@hmail.com
4. Select check-in date: 28/02/2026
5. Select check-out date: 01/03/2026
6. Select 2 adults
7. Click on the "Search" button

**Expected Result:**
- created  the user



